<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-CALENDAR OF AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITIONS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CALENDAR OF AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar of  Confederation of African Football (CAF) club competitions in 1997 announced on Wednesday:</p>
<p>African Champions League:</p>
<p>Preliminary round, first leg - January 31, February 1-2.</p>
<p>Preliminary round, second leg - February 14-16</p>
<p>First round, first leg - March 7-9</p>
<p>First round, second leg - March 21-23</p>
<p>Second round, first leg - May 2-4</p>
<p>Second round, second leg - May 16-18</p>
<p>Champions League, first round - August 22-24</p>
<p>Champions League, second round - September 5-7</p>
<p>Champions League, third round - September 19-21</p>
<p>Champions League, fourth round - October 10-12</p>
<p>Champions League, fifth round - October 24-26</p>
<p>Champions League, sixth round - November 7-9</p>
<p>Final, first leg - November 28-30</p>
<p>Final, second leg - December 12-14</p>
<p>African Cup Winners Cup:</p>
<p>Preliminary round, first leg - January 31, February 1-2</p>
<p>Preliminary round, second leg - February 14-16</p>
<p>First round, first leg - March 7-9</p>
<p>First round, second leg - March 21-23</p>
<p>Second round, first leg - May 2-4</p>
<p>Second round, second leg - May 16-18</p>
<p>Quarter-final, first leg - September 5-7</p>
<p>Quarter-final, second leg - September 19-21</p>
<p>Semifinal, first leg - October 10-12</p>
<p>Semifinal, second leg - October 24-26</p>
<p>Final, first leg - November 21-23</p>
<p>Final, second leg - December 5-7</p>
<p>CAF Cup:</p>
<p>Preliminary round, first leg - January 31, February 1-2</p>
<p>Preliminary round, second leg - February 14-16</p>
<p>First round, first leg - March 7-9</p>
<p>First round, second leg - March 21-23</p>
<p>Second round, first leg - May 2-4</p>
<p>Second round, second leg - May 16-18</p>
<p>Quarter-final, first leg - September 5-7</p>
<p>Quarter-final, second leg - September 19-21</p>
<p>Semifinal, first leg - October 10-12</p>
<p>Semifinal, second leg - October 24-26</p>
<p>Final, first leg - November 14-16</p>
<p>Final, second leg - November 28-30.</p>
</text>
